<title>USA: Golden Books 11 months loss widens.</title>
<headline>Golden Books 11 months loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>11 mos. ended		Year ended</p>
<p>			 Dec 1996		    Feb 1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $8.73     loss	 $3.23</p>
<p> Net loss		 197,503     loss	67,047</p>
<p> Revs		     255,005		  371,294</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of the company is Golden Books Family Entertainment Inc.  </p>
<p>1996 eleven month period includes restructuring charge of $65.7 million.</p>
<p>1996 year ended February includes restructuring charge o $8.7 million and a gain of $2.0 million on streamlining plan.</p>
<p>1996 11 month period net includes preferred stock dividend payments.  </p>
<p>Company changed its fiscal year after a restructuring in May 1996.</p>
